<title>USA: Mac Frugal's Sept same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Mac Frugal's Sept same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DOMINGUEZ, Calif. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mac Frugal's Bargains Close-outs Inc Wednesday said sales for the five weeks ended September 29 were $64.96 million, up 13.7 percent from the $57.1 million reported in the prior year. Same-store sales were up 10 percent.</p>
<p>Year-to-date sales were $431.52 million, up 7.3 percent from the prior year's sales of $402.1 million.  Year-to-date comparable store sales rose 2.0 percent.</p>
